 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 1.4,
   "end": 2.595,
   "text": "Hi, I'm Sierra."
  },
  {
   "start": 2.595,
   "end": 6.044,
   "text": "Here's how CPL Initiative funding works for your college."
  },
  {
   "start": 7.844,
   "end": 11.554,
   "text": "The state set aside thirty-five million dollars in one-time funding."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.554,
   "end": 16.214,
   "text": "About twenty-five million goes directly to one hundred eighteen institutions."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.214,
   "end": 20.164,
   "text": "The rest funds statewide CPL projects, technology,"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.164,
   "end": 23.384,
   "text": "and two Chancellor's Office positions that support colleges."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.184,
   "end": 28.604,
   "text": "Each institution has a maximum allocation for the two years,"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.604,
   "end": 32.389,
   "text": "from one hundred fifty thousand to four hundred thousand dollars."
  },
  {
   "start": 32.389,
   "end": 35.294,
   "text": "The average is about two hundred fourteen thousand."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.694,
   "end": 42.829,
   "text": "Each allocation splits into a credit share and a noncredit share."
  },
  {
   "start": 42.829,
   "end": 46.674,
   "text": "Only noncredit outcomes count toward the noncredit share."
  },
  {
   "start": 48.474,
   "end": 52.149,
   "text": "Two priorities carry the credit funding, in equal shares."
  },
  {
   "start": 52.149,
   "end": 55.149,
   "text": "Access counts applied CPL units."
  },
  {
   "start": 55.149,
   "end": 57.507,
   "text": "Completion counts transcribed CPL units."
  },
  {
   "start": 57.507,
   "end": 62.254,
   "text": "Two noncredit outcomes count toward the noncredit share:"
  },
  {
   "start": 62.254,
   "end": 64.359,
   "text": "exhibits built or adopted, and a CPL portfolio course."
  },
  {
   "start": 64.359,
   "end": 71.594,
   "text": "The Chancellor's Office reports on career attainment together with the innovation projects."
  },
  {
   "start": 73.394,
   "end": 79.824,
   "text": "The model sets each priority's statewide target from its funding and the FTES reimbursement rate:"
  },
  {
   "start": 79.824,
   "end": 83.314,
   "text": "about three thousand six hundred FTES for each."
  },
  {
   "start": 85.114,
   "end": 88.244,
   "text": "Your college has its own target under each priority."
  },
  {
   "start": 88.244,
   "end": 92.449,
   "text": "Thirty semester units of CPL make one FTES."
  },
  {
   "start": 92.449,
   "end": 96.618,
   "text": "For the average allocation, the Access target is about thirty-one FTES."
  },
  {
   "start": 96.618,
   "end": 102.094,
   "text": "Reach half the target, and your college qualifies for half the share."
  },
  {
   "start": 102.094,
   "end": 106.514,
   "text": "The full target qualifies for the full share, and that share is the ceiling."
  },
  {
   "start": 108.314,
   "end": 111.184,
   "text": "Before the Chancellor's Office releases any funding,"
  },
  {
   "start": 111.184,
   "end": 115.349,
   "text": "your college meets three minimum conditions by December thirty-first:"
  },
  {
   "start": 115.349,
   "end": 120.064,
   "text": "assign a CPL coordinator and a Noncredit CPL Lead,"
  },
  {
   "start": 120.064,
   "end": 122.729,
   "text": "listed in MAP and on your college's CPL landing page,"
  },
  {
   "start": 122.729,
   "end": 133.999,
   "text": "who meet regularly; put your local confirmation of participation on file; and upload Joint Services Transcripts for at least seventy-five percent of enrolled veterans."
  },
  {
   "start": 133.999,
   "end": 138.384,
   "text": "Until then, the funding your college demonstrates is held in reserve for it."
  },
  {
   "start": 140.184,
   "end": 143.219,
   "text": "The Chancellor's Office releases funding twice a year,"
  },
  {
   "start": 143.219,
   "end": 146.089,
   "text": "based on your college's CPL to date."
  },
  {
   "start": 146.089,
   "end": 148.834,
   "text": "The full two-year amount is available from year one,"
  },
  {
   "start": 148.834,
   "end": 151.334,
   "text": "and what remains carries forward to year two."
  },
  {
   "start": 153.134,
   "end": 154.444,
   "text": "You won't do this alone."
  },
  {
   "start": 154.444,
   "end": 157.494,
   "text": "Every priority comes with recommended strategies,"
  },
  {
   "start": 157.494,
   "end": 163.134,
   "text": "a CPL Initiative help team supports every college, and detailed guidance will follow."
  },
  {
   "start": 164.934,
   "end": 167.414,
   "text": "Find your college on the CPL funding page."
  }
 ]
